---
import Shell from "../../../../src/astro/v2/Shell.astro";
import { practiceScenarios } from "../../lib/v2-learn.mjs";
const initial = practiceScenarios[0];
const koanSource = `(ns koan.profile)\n\n(def greeting\n  {:message "Hello"})\n\n(require '[tutorial.profile :as profile])\n\nprofile/greeting`;
const tone = (state) => ({ initial: "muted", checking: "signal", failure: "error", "local-pass": "success", "server-verified": "success", "version-changed": "warning", "runtime-unavailable": "error" }[state] ?? "muted");
---
<section class="learn-section" id="practice" aria-labelledby="learn-practice-title">
  <header class="learn-section-heading"><div><p class="hara-v2-kicker">Practice and koans</p><h2 id="learn-practice-title">A focused problem, an inspectable check, and no coercive gate.</h2></div><p>Capability-free exercises run locally. Durable claims require a named verifier. Peer approaches remain hidden until the learner solves the problem.</p></header>
  <div class="learn-practice-scenarios" role="group" aria-label="Practice result states">{practiceScenarios.map((scenario, index) => <button type="button" data-practice-scenario={scenario.id} aria-pressed={index === 0 ? "true" : "false"}><span class="learn-state" data-tone={tone(scenario.state)}>{scenario.label}</span><small>{scenario.state}</small></button>)}</div>
  <Shell embedded={true} sidebar={true} aside={true} density="compact" mainId="learn-practice-workspace" class="learn-practice-shell">
    <aside slot="sidebar" class="learn-practice-prompt"><header><span>Koan 04</span><strong>Resolve the right greeting</strong></header><p>The final form must resolve <code>tutorial.profile/greeting</code> through the alias <code>profile</code>.</p><dl><div><dt>Contract</dt><dd class="learn-mono">learn.exercise@2.0.0</dd></div><div><dt>Revision</dt><dd class="learn-mono">exercise:namespace:1.4.0</dd></div><div><dt>Runtime</dt><dd>Browser/Wasm · no external capabilities</dd></div></dl><details><summary>Hint 1 · inspect the namespace</summary><p>Compare the namespace introduced by <code>ns</code> with the one referenced by <code>require</code>.</p></details><details><summary>Hint 2 · inspect the alias</summary><p>The alias is correct only when it points to the namespace that owns <code>greeting</code>.</p></details><button type="button" data-reveal-solution disabled>Reveal peer approaches after solving</button></aside>
    <div class="learn-practice-editor"><header><span>Exact attempt source</span><strong class="learn-mono">attempt-source:3b621c9f</strong></header><textarea rows="18" spellcheck="false" data-practice-editor>{koanSource}</textarea><footer><button type="button" data-practice-reset>Reset</button><button type="button" data-practice-check class="learn-primary-button">Check locally</button><button type="button" data-practice-save disabled>Save meaningful progress</button></footer></div>
    <aside slot="aside" class="learn-practice-results" aria-live="polite"><header><span>Check result</span><span class="learn-state" data-tone={tone(initial.state)} data-practice-state>{initial.label}</span></header><div class="learn-practice-result-panels">{practiceScenarios.map((scenario, index) => <section data-practice-panel={scenario.id} data-save-allowed={scenario.saveAllowed ? "true" : "false"} hidden={index !== 0}><h3>{scenario.label}</h3><p>{scenario.summary}</p><div class="learn-practice-findings">{scenario.findings.length === 0 ? <p data-empty-findings>No findings yet.</p> : scenario.findings.map((finding) => <article data-severity={finding.severity}><span class="learn-state" data-tone={finding.severity}>{finding.severity}</span><strong>{finding.code}</strong>{finding.line && <small>Line {finding.line} · {finding.path}</small>}<p>{finding.message}</p></article>)}</div><dl><div><dt>Receipt</dt><dd class="learn-mono">{scenario.receipt ?? "No receipt produced"}</dd></div><div><dt>Save progress</dt><dd>{scenario.saveAllowed ? "Available after this meaningful attempt" : "Not available in this state"}</dd></div></dl></section>)}</div><footer><button type="button">Download attempt</button><button type="button">Copy exact receipt</button></footer></aside>
  </Shell>
  <div class="learn-practice-boundaries"><article><span>Local pass</span><p>Immediate browser feedback, not external verification.</p></article><article><span>Server verified</span><p>Exact exercise, curriculum, source, checker, and identity references create durable evidence.</p></article><article><span>Runtime unavailable</span><p>No result exists; preserve source and retry context without marking the learner wrong.</p></article></div>
</section>
